sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter as Eligible Student / Staff
    participant UI as Ballot UI / Modal
    participant Ctrl as Ballot Controller
    participant VoteSvc as VotingService
    participant VoteRepo as VotingRepository
    participant DB as MariaDB / MySQL
    participant Audit as Logger

    Voter->>UI: Select candidate & click "Review & Cast Official Ballot"
    UI->>UI: Show review modal with candidate name confirmation
    Voter->>UI: Click "Confirm & Submit Ballot" (Single-submit lock)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /ballot (election_id, candidate_id, csrf_token)
    
    Ctrl->>VoteSvc: castVote(electionId, candidateId, userId)
    VoteSvc->>VoteRepo: recordBallot(electionId, candidateId, userId, secret)
    
    VoteRepo->>DB: START TRANSACTION
    VoteRepo->>DB: SELECT id FROM elections WHERE id = ? LOCK IN SHARE MODE
    Note over VoteRepo,DB: Verify election is 'open' and within server time
    
    VoteRepo->>DB: SELECT id FROM candidates WHERE id = ? AND election_id = ? LOCK IN SHARE MODE
    Note over VoteRepo,DB: Verify candidate belongs to election and is approved
    
    VoteRepo->>DB: SELECT id FROM election_eligibility WHERE election_id = ? AND user_id = ? LOCK IN SHARE MODE
    Note over VoteRepo,DB: Verify voter is on whitelist
    
    VoteRepo->>DB: SELECT id FROM election_participation WHERE election_id = ? AND user_id = ? FOR UPDATE
    Note over VoteRepo,DB: Exclusive row-lock prevents race conditions
    
    VoteRepo->>VoteRepo: Generate HMAC-SHA256 confirmation receipt token
    VoteRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO election_participation (election_id, user_id, confirmation_hash, voted_at) VALUES (...)
    VoteRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO votes (election_id, candidate_id, cast_at) VALUES (...)
    Note over VoteRepo,DB: Ballot privacy: NO user_id stored in votes table!
    
    VoteRepo->>DB: COMMIT
    VoteSvc->>Audit: Log participation receipt (Redacted, no candidate choice)
    VoteSvc-->>Ctrl: Success + confirmation receipt
    Ctrl-->>UI: Redirect to /confirmation?receipt=xxx
    UI-->>Voter: Display Verified Ballot Receipt & Hash
